pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Reported in functional Operation and Maintenance accounts with the related payroll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:32.233%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:32.233%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:32.234%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Manufactured gas plant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Reported in Other Deductions (426.5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Reported in Other Operation and Maintenance Expenses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Pension and Post-retirement plan non-service costs or credits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Capital portion reported in Electric Plant in Service (101) and Construction Work in Progress (107). Depreciation on capital component is reported in Accumulated Provision for Depreciation of Electric Utility Plant (108) and Depreciation Expense (403). Expense portion reported in Pension and Benefits (926) under Administrative and General.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Portion capitalized for FERC is reported as a regulatory asset or liability for GAAP. Regulatory asset or liability is amortized to Pension and Benefits expense. Expense portion reported in Other Income and Expense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Amortization costs of a hosting arrangement that is considered a service contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Costs amortized over designated average service life for software. Amortization expense and accumulated depreciation reported in Amortization of Limited-term Electric Plant (404) and Accumulated Provision for Amortization of Electric Utility Plant (111).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Costs amortized over the term of the underlying hosting arrangement and reported in Other operation and maintenance expense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;AFUDC &#8211; Allowance for Other Funds Used During Construction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Reported in Property, Plant and Equipment: Construction Work in Progress (107)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;ASU 2018-15 impacts the treatment of implementation of costs of a hosting arrangement that is a service contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left